'.source.gfm, .text.md':
  '1. ... 2. ... 3. ...':
    'prefix': 'lia-list-ordered'
    'body': """
      1. ${1:block}
      2. ${2:block}
      3. ${3:block}
    """
    'description': """
      Insert a Markdown ordered list. LiaScript keeps the numbers you write, so a list can be interrupted and continued, and 0. is a valid start. Indent continuation lines and nested lists to the text of the item.

      Example:
        1. first point
        2. second point
        3. some text

           and some image ![image](img/point.jpg)
    """
    'descriptionMoreURL': 'https://liascript.github.io/course/?https://raw.githubusercontent.com/liaScript/docs/master/README.md'
    'leftLabelHTML': '<span style="color:#ff0">𝌆</span>'

  '* ... + ... - ...':
    'prefix': 'lia-list-unordered'
    'body': """
      + ${1:block}
      + ${2:block}
      + ${3:block}
    """
    'description': """
      Insert a Markdown unordered list, as depicted below. You can use (*+-) to begin every point. Indentation is important in this case.

      Example:
        * first point
        + second point
        - some text

          and some image ![image](img/point.jpg)
    """
    'descriptionMoreURL': 'https://liascript.github.io/course/?https://raw.githubusercontent.com/liaScript/docs/master/README.md'
    'leftLabelHTML': '<span style="color:#ff0">𝌆</span>'


  '<!-- type="a" --> 1. ...':
    'prefix': 'lia-list-type'
    'body': """
      <!-- type="${1:a}" -->
      1. ${2:first}
      2. ${3:second}
      3. ${4:third}
    """
    'body_vscode': """
      <!-- type="${1|a,A,i,I,1|}" -->
      1. ${2:first}
      2. ${3:second}
      3. ${4:third}
    """
    'description': """
      Change the numbering style of an ordered list with an attribute comment directly above it:

        type="a" / "A"   letters
        type="i" / "I"   roman numerals

      Any CSS list style works as well, e.g. <!-- style="list-style-type: lower-greek" -->.

      Example:
        <!-- type="i" -->
        1. first
        2. second
    """
    'descriptionMoreURL': 'https://liascript.github.io/course/?https://raw.githubusercontent.com/liaScript/docs/master/README.md'
    'leftLabelHTML': '<span style="color:#ff0">𝌆</span>'

